{"unit_id":"tag:0943:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。设 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>。不加任何进一步假设，就有映射（map）\n<MATH_0004>。\n具体地，它伴随（adjoint）于典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0005>，\n后者来自映射（map）<MATH_0006> 和引理 <REF_0001> 及 <REF_0002>。下面给出一个相当一般的投影公式（projection formula）版本。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"projection formula","target_term":"投影公式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"投影公式的输入"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"投影比较"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"投影映射的构造"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"拉回后的比较"},{"source_term":"projection formula","target_term":"投影公式","context":"本节的结论"}],"notes":[]}
