{"unit_id":"tag:0944:proof","translation":"为检验（<REF_0001>）为同构（isomorphism），可以在 <MATH_0001> 上局部论证，即对任意对象（object）<MATH_0002>，属于 <MATH_0003>，须找到覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004>，使映射（map）限制（restricts）为 <MATH_0005> 上的同构（isomorphism）。由完美（perfect）对象（objects）的定义，这意味着可假设 <MATH_0006> 由严格（strictly）完美复形（perfect complex）表示，其中各项为 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）。注意，完全一般地，断言对 <MATH_0008> 成立当且仅当它对 <MATH_0009> 和 <MATH_0010> 成立。因此，可假设 <MATH_0011> 是有限（finite）复形（complex），由有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0012>-模（modules）组成。此时，利用朴素截断（stupid truncations）的简单论证，将断言归约到 <MATH_0013> 由有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0014>-模（module）表示的情形。由于断言在 <MATH_0015> 变量中对有限（finite）直和因子（direct summands）不变，只需对 <MATH_0016> 证明，而此时结论平凡。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"perfect","target_term":"完美"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"strictly","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"perfect complex","target_term":"完美复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"stupid truncations","target_term":"朴素截断"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"direct summands","target_term":"直和因子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"投影映射的比较"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"局部化对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部检验"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"投影比较"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制","context":"局部化比较"},{"source_term