{"unit_id":"tag:0E48:statement","translation":"映射（map）（<REF_0001>）与评注 <REF_0002> 的基变换（base change）映射（map）相容，意义如下。具体地，假设\n<MATH_0001>\n为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的交换图（commutative diagram）。设 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>。则图（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n交换（commutative）。这里，标为 <MATH_0005> 的箭头由应用引理 <REF_0003> 得到，标为 <MATH_0006> 的箭头由应用评注 <REF_0004> 得到，标为 <MATH_0007> 的箭头由应用（<REF_0005>）得到，而 <MATH_0008> 来自 <MATH_0009>。省略验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"投影与基变换比较"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"投影公式的相容性"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"比较方块的环境"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"基变换方块"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"投影与基变换比较"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"相容性结论"}],"notes":["原文省略验证，译文保留。"]}
